	// `auth setup` subcommands remain available for inspection and credential
	// bootstrap. The mcp command's flag set is mirrored onto the root so
	// `{{ .CommandName }} --http :8484` / `--read-only` etc. work without the
	// `mcp` subcommand: the flag variables are shared pointers, so the RunE
